{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0474_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bd4acb82016f6b7e21c4b11388f5021aa78201038c28ca12fb20586ba90b1c5c", "ja": "（『伊織の可愛さを世界中に広める』をコンセプトに、\n伊織プロデュースの服が販売されることになった）", "zh": "（以“将伊织的可爱传遍全世界”为理念，伊织亲自打造的服装即将开始销售。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0474_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "71c196bd28d8ee1dc443c8c0d9e39232bd19fe974531b9ff1bbda7cdea196e21", "ja": "ふふん、最高の仕上がりだわ。\nまさに伊織ちゃんのための一着って感じね♪", "zh": "哼哼，成品效果棒极了。\n简直就是专门为伊织打造的服装呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0474_1002_p", "source_sha256": "770538f86e5dddcf3ebbeff8c7b1e0f02ef10dd74432535cde6ae92ef4ba2bc7", "ja": "ああ、本当によく似合ってるよ。\nずいぶん悩んでたけど……その甲斐はあったな。", "zh": "啊，真的很适合你。之前可是苦恼了好一阵子……不过看来这番苦心没有白费。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0474_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "cfffa4b48133bfa5e19a74c8bb1f4ed3992daf715e2cb87a9feaeda7b032c653", "ja": "そうね。私に似合う服って考えたら、あれこれ\n思いついちゃって……本当に、大変だったわ。", "zh": "是啊。一想到适合我的服装，就不由得冒出各种各样的想法……真的很费工夫呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0474_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "c1ddfa667cbc27c98c394b284990a26986e4f9dc2693b5bf34c635e4c5e87c60", "ja": "でも色々案を出したおかげで、それぞれのいいところを\n取り入れた特別な一着になったし……結果オーライね！", "zh": "不过，多亏我提出了各种方案，最后成了一件融合了各自优点的特别服装……结果还是挺好的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0474_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4b66f279093949c84b605001c5e3378300966a631004c18e3188e7579a3a6a2d", "ja": "うん。どの要素も伊織にマッチしているしな。\nけど、最初コンセプトを聞いた時は驚いたよ。", "zh": "嗯。每个元素都很适合伊织。不过，刚听到最初的设计理念时，我可是吓了一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0474_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ad6b6323c537c89a1dcd796a2a929812d7b59b9a5bca0a250142166a6dad73f5", "ja": "一般販売もされるのに、広く誰にでも着こなせる服とは\n正反対のイメージなんだもんな。", "zh": "明明也会面向普通消费者销售，给人的印象却和谁都能轻松驾驭的服装完全相反。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0474_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "bc2cf9380520dc6eedbccc0edf724e1b5720185b61a179d80b1c2cdebf74cde1", "ja": "ふふっ。アンタだってわかってるでしょ？ そこは\nファンのみんなとの信頼関係ってやつよ。", "zh": "呵呵，你也明白的吧？关键就在于和粉丝们之间的信赖关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0474_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "58fe048e5fc266cd0bbeda99fbf3fb7403d310b378422960ef233f733839410f", "ja": "みんなも絶対この方が嬉しいもの！　世界に誇れる、\n一番カワイイ伊織ちゃんが見られるんだから♪", "zh": "大家也绝对更喜欢这样嘛！因为能看到\n足以向全世界夸耀的、最可爱的小伊织呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0474_1009_p", "source_sha256": "10b314533c60400a3b166c54ff9fbc8676e4ceab7bcb888ed09230911d26e737", "ja": "なるほど。まあそれに、伊織に似合う服が、\n他の人に似合わないってわけでもないしな。", "zh": "原来如此。而且，适合伊织的衣服，也不是就不适合其他人嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0474_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "6de514da4266c93e61d8a781fcd9444acb4295acdf4bf7b505b232ed001106be", "ja": "そうそう。私が一番カワイイのは仕方ないけど、\n『カワイイ』は私だけのものじゃないもの！", "zh": "没错没错。虽然我最可爱是没办法的事，但“可爱”又不是只属于我一个人的东西！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0474_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "72c134ce81508a0160218585a7fa398a1a092e0f109d01aa67b6ac9fd5f284d4", "ja": "みんなもどんどん着たらいいの！　私も見てみたいし\nね。みんなが、どんな風に着こなすのか……。", "zh": "大家也尽管穿起来嘛！我也想看看，大家会怎么搭配……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0474_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a9f8775920ebd0b86beed8fa90f43f70fcd629f4c6b34153e65d0b0aac889c67", "ja": "そうだな。発売されて話題になれば、街中で見かける\nことも出てくるだろうけど……。", "zh": "是啊。发售后要是引起话题，应该也能在街上看到有人穿吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0474_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "c307c71cab069bfbab726bdde4bb247fff9f7fcc2957c84c0380e2ed0fc7d6a2", "ja": "あら、「話題になれば」なんて、ずいぶんのん気ね。\n話題は作るものよ！　ほら、スマホ出して。", "zh": "哎呀，“要是引起话题”什么的，还真是悠闲呢。\n话题可是要自己制造的！来，把手机拿出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0474_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e049ddc742649c34462e823cd753fdf9dab8dcbc811d51236b454848b196e0f1", "ja": "話題を作る？　スマホ？\nあ、なるほど、SNSを利用して……。", "zh": "制造话题？还有手机？\n啊，原来如此，是利用社交媒体……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0474_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "b39fac067cef145fb49e8118b29dffe7e3799d2857712162a89ab42038ad5e00", "ja": "そ。企画用のハッシュタグを作って\n写真をあげるときにつけてもらうようにするとかね。", "zh": "对。比如制作一个企划专用的话题标签，让大家发照片时带上之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0474_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "d0bd5d5111484e940671dea39f5753394ce6edbe0d9ae13c344513ec9411bbf2", "ja": "そうすれば画像もすぐに見つけられるし、\n盛り上がれば世界規模で広がっていくわ！", "zh": "这样一来就能马上找到照片了，\n要是热闹起来，还会在全世界传播开来呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0474_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "57758d79015b55294af91ddad8eb7ece496d26c3a626dbebb8d437e004413c35", "ja": "ううん……「盛り上がれば」、じゃないわね。\n私も参加するんだし、盛り上がること間違いなし、ね♪", "zh": "不对……不是“要是热闹起来”呢。\n毕竟我也要参加，肯定能大受欢迎的，对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0474_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6ae5604865f07e7bc81e5cf581924bf53d79e01569b304fb3bb6b787fdb2f397", "ja": "うん、面白い企画だな。何より、この服の\nコンセプトとマッチしているのがいいな！", "zh": "嗯，是个很有意思的企划。最重要的是，和这身衣服的设计理念很契合，这点真不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0474_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "8d6074da8297215e8b5efc62723e36db9aa0a0ccb7bc3f5f232c1d1a08f5fe8e", "ja": "でしょ？　じゃあ、すぐに準備開始よ！\nとびっきりの一枚、撮ってちょうだい！　にひひっ♪", "zh": "对吧？那就马上开始准备吧！\n给我拍一张最棒的照片！嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
